E0%B8%87%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%97%E0%B8%B3%E0%B8%87._%E0%B9%92%E0%B9%92%E0%B9%91%E0%B9%91%E0%B9%92%E0%B9%98_40.jpg\" style=\"width: 400px; height: 266px;\" /><img alt=\"\" src=\"/kcfinder/upload/images/LINE_ALBUM_%E0%B8%9B%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B0%E0%B8%8A%E0%B8%B8%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%A3%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%B3%E0%B8%AB%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%94%E0%B8%99%E0%B9%82%E0%B8%A2%E0%B8%9A%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A2%E0%B9%81%E0%B8%A5%E0%B8%B0%E0%B8%97%E0%B8%B4%E0%B8%A8%E0%B8%97%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%97%E0%B8%B3%E0%B8%87._%E0%B9%92%E0%B9%92%E0%B9%91%E0%B9%91%E0%B9%92%E0%B9%98_39.jpg\" style=\"width: 400px; height: 266px;\" /></div>\r\n', '<p style=\"margin-bottom:13px\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span sans-serif=\"\" style=\"font-family:Calibri,\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">27 November 2022, Agriculture Research Development Agency (Public Organization), or ARDA, held a meeting to set policy, and work directly for the year 2023 led by Mr. Chavalit Chookajorn, Chairman of the Board Committees of the Agricultural Research Development Agency (Public Organization), presided the meeting. Together with board committees of ARDA, ARDA executives, experts, and sub-committees to listen to comments and include receiving the important policies in the operation of ARDA in the year 2023 at the Phumiphat conference room, Bangkok Oasis Hotel, Bangkok, and meeting via online media (Zoom Cloud Meetings).</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:13px\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span sans-serif=\"\" style=\"font-family:Calibri,\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></span></span><img alt=\"\"